The export flow can be done this way:
UI user press export button -> gateway -> product service -> export process
                                                                  |
                                                        Create UsId-csv on files directory
                                                                  |
                                                        Send notification to Pulsar

Notify service --> Gateway (SSE) --> UI alert --> Button display --> download file (maybe with a thead or process or maybe is not necessary)
      |
Send email to user

Timer to delete files every day


The import flow can be done this way:
UI user press import button -> gateway -> product service -> import process
                                                                  |
                                                             Update DB
                                                                  |
                                                        Send notification to Pulsar

Notify service --> Gateway(SSE) --> UI alert
      |
Send email to user



For the stock visualization at the frontend:
- Add attribute stockLabel to the Product entity and DTO
- Make a listener to check inventory update events.
      - Save the product label if the label is different of the product bd
      - Labels: With Stock, Low Stock, Last Units, Sold Out


IMPORTANT NOTES
- Inventory service MUST return the stocks ORDER BY product.id at exportation calls
- With Stock, Low Stock, Last Units, Sold Out messages
